new_audit = r"""To evaluate data hygiene, we conducted an algorithmic duplicate audit on the public poultry disease benchmark published by Dianyo et al. on Hugging Face (\texttt{Dianyo/poultry-fecal-fl}) \cite{dianyo2022fecal}, which compiled 8,770 fecal images (7,016 train / 1,754 test) derived from the field dataset of Machuve et al. (Zenodo record 4628934) \cite{machuve2021poultry}, categorized into four diagnostic classes: Healthy, Coccidiosis, Salmonella, and Newcastle Disease."""

