old_disc = r"""Third, system designers must rigorously enforce class-conditional safety constraints during compression. Unweighted channel pruning and dynamic quantization continuously starve the lethal minority pathogen (\textit{Newcastle Disease}, 8.16\% prevalence), collapsing NCD recall from 94.33\% to 61.70\% at 30\% sparsity and 31.21\% at 50\% sparsity. Inverse-frequency weighting ($w_{\text{NCD}}=3.05$) with FP32 teacher distillation significantly recovers sensitivity to 86.52\% [79.91\%, 91.20\%]. For operational deployment on Raspberry Pi 5, \textbf{ShuffleNetV2 Baseline Static QDQ} (6.29\,ms, 159.1 FPS, 97.57\% accuracy, 94.33\% NCD recall [89.20\%, 97.10\%]) and \textbf{MobileNetV2 Baseline Static QDQ} (7.59\,ms, 131.8 FPS, 97.74\% accuracy, 94.33\% NCD recall [89.20\%, 97.10\%]) represent the optimal deployment configurations, satisfying real-time throughput and strict clinical sensitivity without accuracy compromise."""

